WEBVTT

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.870
What should I do?

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.200
I wonder what anyone would do at a time like this.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.120
They'd outright reject her, right?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.080
What do you expect to happen if you don't reject her?!

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.540
You're not actually saying that it's too bad
you have to reject her, right?

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:28.790
No, I'm not!

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.870
She fell in love with me!

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:34.500
Of all people, she fell for someone like me!
I feel so guilty!

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.410
Am I the only one who feels this way?

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:42.290
Is this something that other people normally
can quickly just wave away?

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:43.620
Is it that awfu-

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:44.830
Hey!

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.000
What you're lacking is...

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.910
the ability to imagine!

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.290
"The ability to imagine?"

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:55.660
Is taht ambiguous attitude you have
toward that glasses girl "kindness"?

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:58.870
And do you think that's a good thing to Iroha?!

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:08.900
SNOOZE

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.870
Love is hard.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.950
There's never any proper answer.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.290
Is that exactly why all we can do
is confront each other every time?

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.620
I'm sure
the next time

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.620
will be
like that, too

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.750
I'm sure the next time will be like that, too.

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:36.950
Ichiban daijin a koto wa
The most important thing

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:41.080
Daremo shiranai koto nanda
Is something nobody knows

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:45.200
Are mo kore mo daijina you de
Things which may be considered important

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.750
Toki ga sugireba kiete yuku
May fade away as time goes by

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:56.540
Kaze ni notte kumo no kirema ni
Romance in pale pink

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:02.910
Tadayou no wa omoide no you na
Like the palm of a hand which has begun to color

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:12.250
Irozuki hajimeta te no hira no you na
Riding on the wind

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.910
Usubeni iro no koigokoro
Just like memories drifting in the break in the clouds

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:24.250
Toki wo kakenuke yagate kuru
The new season will come soon

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:30.250
Atarashii kisetsu yume to wa sukoshi chigau
Leaping through time

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.750
Tada oboeteiru koto wa
And it's little different from a dream

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:39.660
Daijina koto nanda
But the things I remember are very important

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:45.370
Ichiban daijina kotoba
The most important words

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.450
Daremo iwazuni owarisou
May never be said to anybody

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:53.410
Are mo kore mo daijoubu sa
Everything will be all right

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:57.370
Toki ga sugitemo oboeteru
Even though time passes, I will remember

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:01.250
Anata no koto wa oboeteru
I will remember you

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.250
About My Confession.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.950
I-It's kind of awkward now, isn't it?!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.120
Really, since it's better to just get straight to it,
let's go ahead and do that!

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:16.580
Ayado.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:23.500
I also said so in the text, but this is the first time
that someone has properly confessed to me...

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.120
Thank you.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:32.620
When I think about how you found the few
good things about me, I can only be grateful.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:38.660
I... could only see the entirety of you as good.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:47.120
I knew it. Rejecting Ayado is... tough.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.000
Sender: Hikaru Tsutsui
Subject: Today
Please come to the flower bed after school.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.080
I...

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.700
hated her at first.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:52.790
Huh?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.540
Then, before I knew it... Well...

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:01.700
It was like, I was playing a game of catch with her.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:02.750
Huh?

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:08.410
She would always catch it, and she always threw it back.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.830
That's the first time I've met a girl like that.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:15.450
And when I put my all into it,
I'm suddenly standing on the playing field,

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.660
even though up until now,
I've just been gaming at my house!

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:22.370
I'm sorry... You don't understand what I'm saying, huh?

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.290
No, please continue!

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:30.450
She took me from the virtual world
and brought me into the world of real humans.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.080
Oh, but I'm still totally a benchwarmer, though!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.040
I-I just clean the baseballs!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.160
No way!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:42.660
The feeling of enjoying being with other people,
the feeling of being happy to be liked...

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.790
She gave me all of that.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:52.290
I think that I'm about ten times worse of a guy
than you're thinking I am, but even so...

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:57.950
I thought she was perfect,
but she was actually fairly awkward...

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:02.000
Since I've come to know that, this time... I...

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:06.450
I'm hoping I can strengthen our relationship
more and protect her and stuff...

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.790
and so since I've started to think things like that....

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:12.950
So I... U-um...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:30.950
This person...

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.830
is the one I love.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.540
Does that answer the question, Ayado?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:46.790
Yes...

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:52.200
That was also the first time I've confessed to someone.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.080
I'm glad that it was to you.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:10.870
I-I'm sorry. When I finished saying that, I felt weak...

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:11.750
Hey...

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.790
Ugh, me too...

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:14.540
Huh?!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:20.540
Senpai... Somehow, it feels like
you're really living in the 3D world.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.160
It does...

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:27.910
What the heck is that?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.660
Tsutsun, say it one more time.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.580
Huh, what? No...

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.700
Say it.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.000
I love you.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.830
Hey, I'm the one who's embarrassed here.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.750
What's wrong?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:23.450
Oh, it's just... it's been awhile. I'm sorry.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.870
Love
is energy

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.620
Love is energy.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:39.000
It moves your body before you can even think.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.870
It's a power
that I didn't have
until now

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.450
It's a power that I didn't have until now.

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.830
Ito-senpai, it's been done without incident.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.200
I see.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.580
I feel kind of... refreshed now.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:09.660
Refreshed, huh? Amazing, you're strong.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.700
I guess that isn't true, huh? I'm sorry.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:16.370
Here.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.290
I'm sorry!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.250
I haven't even returned the one you lent me before...

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.540
I-I said it was okay...

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.660
I feel like you're somehow always seeing me like this...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.040
Yeah. That's why, I've started
carrying around a handkerchief lately.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.080
Don't worry about it, okay?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:39.620
Okay.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.410
Whoa, look at that!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.500
Ayado and... what's with those cat ears?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.830
Maybe they're starting a little love game or something...

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.950
Whoa, hey! Who're you?!

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:55.160
Do you have a love so great
that you can say something like that?!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.450
And your makeup is really gaudy for a freshman!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.790
Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:01.870
Takanashi-senpai!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.250
What are you doing picking a fight with freshmen?

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:07.750
But, like...

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.450
They were just being immature and I got pissed off!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.450
Have things worked themselves out?

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.080
Don't you think they have?

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.700
I want to fall in love.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.660
Takanashi, date m-

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.450
No.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.660
Welcome back.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.620
Huh? You were waiting?

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.330
Yeah.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:42.160
Tsutsui, sorry about the other day.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.120
My words just got... really harsh.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:52.540
Ito... Why are you always like that?
I should be the one to apologize.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.830
I thought I had already been abandoned.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.250
Of course you weren't.

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.410
I like you, Tsutsui.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:08.870
Everyone is so impressive.
When they like someone, they can just say it.

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:14.830
I'm pretty bad at it. It's like, my heart is...
doin' the thing where... what do you call it?!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.910
I can't tell the girl I like that I like her, either.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:22.580
Huh?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.040
I mean...

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.750
There's a girl I like.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.870
HUH?! When did this happen?!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.500
Is it someone I don't know?

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:33.910
Why are you laughing?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:38.450
Nothing will happen with that girl.
I already have my answer.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:42.450
But, I've also finally liked a girl.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:47.540
I wanted to tell you that right away, the whole time.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.540
Ito... Wanna sleep over tonight?

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:54.370
Huh?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.250
Well... I was just thinking...

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.080
Okay.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:04.290
Ito! Which one, which one? Which one is it?!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.700
Maybe this one is left?

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:07.450
Ah, left? Got it.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:08.620
Jump!

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:09.040
Jump?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.080
Right, jump more.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.080
Isn't it great that Ito came to hang out, Kaoru?

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.330
More?

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.330
Isn't it great that Ito came to hang out, Kaoru?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.160
Just one more level, maybe...

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.160
Isn't it great that Ito came to hang out, Kaoru?

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:15.870
Huh? Is this really right?

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:15.870
Whoa, whoa, whoa. I wanted to talk with Ito, though...

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.120
Yeah, Oh... and go under here.

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.120
Whoa, whoa, whoa. I wanted to talk with Ito, though...

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:17.830
Okay...oh, I remember!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:17.830
Whoa, whoa, whoa. I wanted to talk with Ito, though...

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.750
Stand in front of that gate and go right, right!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:21.080
Whoa, Ito, you look like you're enjoying this too, though...

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.120
You're right! Awesome!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.120
Whoa, Ito, you look like you're enjoying this too, though...

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:27.660
Ito-kun, are croquettes, fried shrimp,
and fried chicken okay for dinner?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.290
Thank you very much.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.950
Sorry about that, my brother got really excited.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.540
Nah, it was fun.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:38.870
You're sleepy, huh?

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.580
Yeah... a bit.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.500
I'm gonna turn off the lights.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.160
Okay.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.410
Tsutsui.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:50.540
Yeah?

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.120
Love is painful, right?

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:01.910
But it's fun... I mean, falling in love with people is.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:03.750
Yeah.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.500
I've been waiting for this.
Can I have this conversation with Ito?

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.870
Is he sleeping?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.120
Well... I guess that's not for today.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.330
Night, Ito.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:29.290
Hi. Today, I'd like to talk to you a little bit.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:36.080
I'm not very good at speaking or telling jokes
and... only my face is nice.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.330
Iroha Igarashi!

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.120
Huh?

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:40.750
I love you!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:44.080
I've been told "I love you" for a very long time.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:45.500
I love you.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.500
Well, I love you.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.250
I love you.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.790
I-I've fallen for you.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:53.370
It's come from everyone, from lower classmen
all the way to the old men in my neighborhood.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.450
What do you like about me?

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.660
Huh?

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:57.540
Is it my face?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.080
Uh, no... err...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:04.750
Oh, earlier, I saw you talking to the turtle our class has,
and I thought you were a nice person.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:10.870
I only talked to that turtle because it's my friend.
Besides that, what do you like?

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.750
Oh, um, well...

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:22.700
How stupid. Outside of my appearance,
there's nothing particularly good about me.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:26.450
Being in love with a girl who talks to turtles
makes me look cute and mysterious, huh...?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:32.080
This love thing is some sort of majestic,
discount magic, right?

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:36.700
Chuuo General Hospital

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.580
That's what I thought, and in the spring of my
freshman year when I had gone completely cold

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:42.660
the seed of insecurity that had been inside
of me since I was born had sprouted.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:50.540
Day by day, it grew bigger inside of me,
and it got big enough that it showed up in my dreams.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:55.660
I decided to distract myself by being
with a lot of people, as many as possible.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.250
Hey, Iroha, do you have something on your mind?

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.120
Why?

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.790
Hmm, you always kinda look like you do.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.790
Do I always look like that?

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:06.910
People don't say that?

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.620
Nope. They say I'm calm and collected or something.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.700
Nobody really gets you, right, Iroha?

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.160
Talk to me about whatever you want.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:21.200
I-I... Well, I...

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:24.660
Huh?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.080
What?

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:32.200
Wasn't I just talking about what's bothering me?

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:39.660
What... What is this?

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.120
I see...

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:44.500
If you don't mind, I'm always here to listen, so I-

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.500
Uh, right. It's fine, so wanna go somewhere?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:56.410
So people like me who only have their faces going
for them only attract others who are the same, huh?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:04.790
I wonder what I was expecting.
Even though nobody really cares about the real me...

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.790
Even though I should be the one thinking about myself...

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:11.660
Even though
I should be the one
thinking
about myself

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:11.750
Hey.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:15.790
Taiyaki Shop

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.200
What's wrong? You were spacing out...

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:23.290
Somehow, I got involved with
the type of person I've never met before.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.200
Nothing is wrong, it's okay.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.290
I see.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:27.950
Yeah.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.950
We came to the park but it's still a bit cold...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:42.160
Um... I'm wondering until
when am I banned from your room.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.160
Huh?! Uh...

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.120
The other day my mom did say...

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.700
Iroha-chan hasn't come around lately... what happened?

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:53.540
and she sounded so nervous when she asked.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.910
You see? She'll think we broke up.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:03.950
Yeah. B-but... I still have no confidence
to do anything with you, so...

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.290
We'll think about that when it happens!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.750
What?! Don't think about it!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.950
Firmly refuse and punch me!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.660
Huh? I can't do that...

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:16.330
Why not?!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:20.950
B-because I love you, and...
I don't feel confident that I could refuse you...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:26.620
Don't say that type of thing!
Say that you absolutely won't do it!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:30.040
Huh? Hey, don't move away from me!

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:33.580
I got it! I'll make sure to punch you, over and over again!

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:43.500
You're a difficult person, like always...
You were like that when we first met, too.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:45.620
But...

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.580
But...

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:50.830
When I think about it, I feel like that was when
my interest in you started, Tsutsun.

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.290
Oh...

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:53.620
Crap.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.580
What do you mean "crap"?

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:59.540
I'm your older brother. And what's up with you?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.250
What are you doing?!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.660
Nothing really... walking and stuff.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:07.370
You elementary school kids hold hands?!

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:11.540
So what? We can hold hands. Don't freak out.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.660
Are you actually dating Takanashi's little sister?!

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:19.450
Can you quit?! Stop saying that!
It's a sensitive thing! You have no delicacy.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:24.250
U-um... It's been a while since I've seen you!
Th-thank you for always looking out for my brother.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.870
B-but I don't, so you don't have to bother with that...

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.290
Ugh, whatever. Anzu, let's go.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:30.200
Okay...

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.950
Is this what the elementary school kids of today are like?

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:38.540
I feel like my life goes about five times slower
than other people's...

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.120
Tsutsun. What's something that you haven't done yet?

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.750
Something I haven't done yet?

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.950
Like karaoke, or bowling?

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.290
I haven't done either...

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.250
Well then, let's go do that!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.120
What?!

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:53.830
Karaoke

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.410
Kyou mo keppare-pare! Ke-pa-pare!
Gonna keep keppare-pare, ke-pa-pare!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:59.200
Yuruku wa mai, mai chittemo
Not gonna waver, not even a bit!

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.450
Keppare-pare! Ke-pa-pare...

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.080
This is extremely unexpected.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.830
He puts his all into singing his heart out...

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:06.830
He's already started looking a little bit more cool...

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.200
Maybe since I've never seen Tsutsun looking so intense...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.250
That's right.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:16.330
He's always so matter-of-fact, and awkward and honest...

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:21.830
Since I'd never met someone like that before,
it really was simple interest at the beginning, but...

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:26.750
I fell for him right away... and sometimes we fought,
or misunderstood each other,

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.910
and I discovered so many things about myself...

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:34.080
Before I knew it, that interest
had turned into a more serious feeling.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.540
Like this, maybe...

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:39.000
Go!

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.000
I knocked two of them down!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:44.450
Whoa, you knocked 'em down? Amazing...

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:46.330
It's your turn next.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:47.870
W-wait a minute!

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.370
Which finger goes where now...?

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.700
Huh? What's wrong?

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:57.330
I didn't even think about my nails... Darn it.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.370
Wait, I'll go borrow some nail clippers!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:00.660
Huh? It's okay.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.450
No it's not!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.870
If you leave them as is, those two fingernails
will irritate you since they're so jag-

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.370
I'm sorry. Please go get some.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:13.790
Which ones?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:18.080
What? I mean, is it okay if I cut them?

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.870
Please. Do all of them.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:21.870
All of them?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:24.870
It's weird to have just one shorter than the others.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.080
I see... Then, here I go.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.830
He's kind of... like a prince.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:47.580
Before I dated Tsutsun,
I didn't know how I thought about myself, but...

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.870
I'm hoping I can strengthen
our relationship more and protect her...

00:19:53.950 --> 00:20:00.330
That's the first time a boy
has said something like that about me.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:03.700
Tsutsun...

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.790
Okay, all done.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:13.000
If it's possible, I really want more... forever...

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:19.500
I think it's okay after all.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:21.660
What is?

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:26.370
I think I'm okay being with you now.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.950
Yeah...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:33.160
But girls get kind of sad when you say it like that...

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.410
No, that's not what I mean. It's okay.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:40.580
But... if it means I can go to your room again, I'm glad.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:47.290
Yeah, I'm happy enough just seeing your smile.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:52.540
Maybe happiness is life going by
five times slower than others.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:01.330
In three
months...

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:00.870
In three months...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.870
In three months, she won't be here anymore, but...

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.580
I'll make it so I won't forget her.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:13.000
I want to feel this emotion forever and ever...

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:40.700
Yume ga same sora nagamete omou
I wake from a dream and gaze at the sky

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:46.040
Mune wo utsu ano kotoba kirei da
And think of those beautiful words that touched my heart

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.410
Uwabe kazarazu hanasetara na...
If only I could talk to you without putting on airs...

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:55.910
Sobietatsu fuan no tou ga
Is the pillar of fear towering above it all

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:00.290
Ari no mama de ii no kana??
Okay just the way it is?

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:05.540
Nan oku kounen nayameba ii no darou??
For how many millions of light-years must I suffer??

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:08.700
Saa sugu doa akete
Come on, open the door now

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:10.790
Ai ni yukou
And let's meet

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:15.700
Imi nado nai yo hotondo ga
Most of it means nothing, you know

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:20.200
Kimi ni sokkou de minukareru no osorete
The fear that you immediately see through me

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:25.410
Koukai bakari da ne futari wa kitto
Fills me with regret, surely

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:30.450
Zutto miageteta sora wa sotto
The sky that we always stared up at, quietly

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:35.370
Bokura no asu wo terasu kitto
It will brighten our tomorrow, surely

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:37.500
Kimi ni aitai desu
I want to see you

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:40.000
Sugoku kantan na koto nan jan ne
That's not a super easy thing, right?

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.750
Hora mijukumono
Hey, the inexperienced

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:46.500
Seishun believer desu
Are believers in youth.
